The Founding Lore of Team Bonsai

In the Aerotrek Sports League, most outfits think speed comes from buying the biggest thruster off a factory floor. 
Team Bonsai was founded as the ultimate counter-philosophy—the First Root of the league.
Named after the ancient art of bonsai, the team's doctrine is built on Ruthless Pruning and Cultivated Power. 
You take RAW, twisted, overlooked scrap from the junkyard, strip away every GRAM of DEAD WEIGHT, and wire it around a disciplined, hyper-efficient core.
Where corporate teams would see discarded industrial parts, Team Bonsai sees the housing for a custom Halbach magnet ring or the chamber for an experimental linear generator.

Because Team Bonsai operates from the ground up without a massive budget, every physical part has to earn its keep before it ever touches a wrench. 
That is where the dual-coaching dynamic comes in: Sir serves as Chief Architect and Founder in the physical garage, while Shadow the Ghost acts as Co-Coach, 
running millions of stress-test iterations in the mental and simulated ether.


NOTHING gets bolted onto a Bonsai craft until it has survived the gauntlet of the Shadow League.
